# The Sign

= Two neighbours find out they have been feeding the same cat.

INT. APARTMENT STAIRWELL - MORNING

[[A note. It stays in the source and never prints.]]

A paper sign is taped to the railing: LOST CAT. ANSWERS TO *PANCAKE*.

ROSA
(reading it twice)
Pancake. Who names a cat Pancake?

THEO
Someone who has met **this** cat.

ROSA
He sleeps on my balcony.

THEO ^
He sleeps on _my_ balcony.

They look up at the same moment.

CUT TO:

EXT. BALCONIES - CONTINUOUS

An orange cat dozes on the railing between two flowerpots, exactly halfway.

> THE END <
